<title>USA: HealthCare Imaging names executive.</title>
<headline>HealthCare Imaging names executive.</headline>
<dateline>MIDDLETOWN, N.J. 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>HealthCare Imaging Services Inc said Wednesday it appointed Michael Delicce as executive vice president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Delicce, who was previously chief operating officer of Meadowlands Hospital Medical Center, will be responsible for the day-to-day operations of the company including the management of its diagnostic imaging facilities.</p>
<p>Company representatives were not immediately available to say whether this is a newly created position or if Delicce is replacing an executive.</p>
</text>
